<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#111;">Your sign-in code</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 20px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#3a3a3a;">Enter this code to sign in:</p>

<div style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0;">
  <span style="display:inline-block;font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:30px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.3em;color:#111;background:#f5f5f4;border:1px solid #e7e5e4;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 20px 14px 26px;"><%= @code %></span>
</div>

<p style="margin:0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#8a8175;">It expires in <%= @ttl_minutes %> minutes. If you didn't request it, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
